{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_title", "source_sha256": "39d3f31b79b8dd53b7d7b78c85e7f5e11684647cb3c417763a3a3001fc75b98e", "ja": "あなたと共に", "zh": "与你同行", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fee0285eeb1dcb0983feecf6c7a0664ba19aaeebf91cf7c7c54cc00e1d4e2ce1", "ja": "記者に狙われた千鶴は、プロデューサーに\n実家の真実を公表することを提案され口論に\nなる。しかしお互いの真意を理解しあった後\n二人はそれぞれの想いを認め合い、再び理想\nの『二階堂千鶴』を目指そうと決意する。", "zh": "千鹤被记者盯上后，制作人建议她\n公布老家的实情，两人因此产生争执。\n但在相互理解彼此的真心后，两人认可了\n各自的想法，决意再次以理想的“二阶堂千鹤”\n为目标迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8c233335aed6e85bb6ba11da78e4878a16f26419e7d5c2c12058f8653a9ecf76", "ja": "前日のこと……", "zh": "前一天的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d2c3c436e8333fd38a7884fb4a4b5232daa4bf3a5de920e1185700e53cb22801", "ja": "それじゃ、千鶴さん。状況が落ち着くまでは、\nこのホテルで過ごしてもらえればと……。", "zh": "那么，千鹤小姐。在情况稳定下来之前，还请你先住在这家酒店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5379390009f68b3668ae097c6396de76ad96a958114f5c77705ecd12181fcdb9", "ja": "しばらく不便だと思いますが、必要なものは\n言ってくれれば持ってきますから。", "zh": "这段时间可能会有些不方便，不过需要什么就告诉我，我会带过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "23af060739ef8cbb68aea2a70225e624671b8b435dae81129c868e429fda7538", "ja": "ええ、わかりましたわ……。{$P$}、\nこんな生活、いつまで続くんですの？", "zh": "好的，我明白了……。{$P$}先生，这样的生活还要持续到什么时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b27787b568971806a5123df5167fc65acb2c6f8e9af92a3c2703dd895080d1c7", "ja": "ちょっと、今は何とも……。とにかく記者が諦めそうな\n手立てがないと、何とも……。", "zh": "这个嘛，现在实在不好说……总之，要是没有能让记者放弃的办法，就实在是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "13dce3398fdbd15e180f154d88189d0928b0d04c5a7ba0fcc2c071026c76666b", "ja": "……そうですわね。\nごめんなさい、答えのないことを聞いて……。", "zh": "……确实如此呢。\n对不起，问了个没有答案的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1006_p", "source_sha256": "22c65419a2c3f4f6eba5ad842d8dc124ce5afd59e84f96a312eb116cb8db8333", "ja": "ただ……。実は、手がないこともない。\n……とは、思ってます。", "zh": "只是……其实，也不是完全没有办法。……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "3bcc3aa753927937c5e6e3d41544ee434397defa4156db1a7b7bfc7e60900d6c", "ja": "まあ！　さすがですわね！\nどうするおつもりですの？", "zh": "哎呀！不愧是您！\n您打算怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1e589a1f385f85a4f6b58a175fa82166c6375742882a116ed2df5689a6214ec2", "ja": "その……。\n千鶴さんの、ご実家のこと……なんですが。", "zh": "那个……是关于千鹤小姐老家的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d3447119c3074b5cb9bd678ef9d8c726605a4730459bb0cd8421eec1bf82bb53", "ja": "いっそ、公表しませんか。\nこの機会に、思い切って！", "zh": "干脆就公开吧。\n趁这个机会，下定决心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "7da0109ef0cc1a1c01b0e2d2637b5f5d6005d7de994eba09fd931532a8d6a334", "ja": "……なんですって？", "zh": "……你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "db6939201cd0bb783b64103183ced2a520f0ead1bc2a71705ff2301ec87c7080", "ja": "いや、このまま週刊誌にすっぱ抜かれるくらいなら、\n先手を打った方が……！", "zh": "不，与其就这样被周刊杂志曝光，\n还不如先发制人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "1de624abfee0c196b8b6b13d34a39e9339cc350f383c6701ffe630c21d477cbb", "ja": "なにをおっしゃってますの？\nどうして……、どうして貴方が、そんな……！！", "zh": "您在说什么呀？\n为什么……为什么您会变成这样……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "25044c024d711511da287d6b2b18fa07b2b831b0a2bd80e8a2ea582538b6c6da", "ja": "それを譲ってしまったら、二階堂千鶴は！\nわたくしは、わたくしではなくなりますわ！", "zh": "要是把那个拱手让人，二阶堂千鹤就会！我就不再是我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9435d008827f6eb2379db7df3ab934646ca7fb3d8e598685fe03ad59e6f7e84f", "ja": "大丈夫です、千鶴さんは千鶴さんです！\n高貴で優しい心を持った立派な女性で、アイドルです！", "zh": "没事的，千鹤小姐就是千鹤小姐！\n是一位拥有高贵而温柔内心的出色女性，也是一位优秀的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "a6f003b92d22a5fbed7d405153d90ac7859cc7ea80854983704173dbeb5c6ade", "ja": "そういうことじゃないの！！", "zh": "不是这个意思啦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1017_p", "source_sha256": "db6f97819d26f417c7c1547706758f3790ae657aad80bf2a556fe3f55cb38c99", "ja": "！　千鶴さん……。", "zh": "！千鹤小姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "0cf501dc80da7eca1bf511b7ff16e871a0c6745f687f5dd7aeba946ee365159d", "ja": "セレブであるということは、わたくしにとって……。\nいいえ、わたくしだけではありませんわ。", "zh": "身为名媛，对我来说……  \n不，不只是对我而言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "1981aeae1cd902fc1674101ae90ed5f9ae9c76d152dd1590e3b97e473d034515", "ja": "わたくしの家族や商店街の皆様、ファンの皆様、\nそれと……。貴方との、大切な……証で、夢で。", "zh": "我的家人、商店街的各位、各位粉丝，还有……这是与您之间重要的……证明，也是梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "e51761c2e54d30ac89a3374f038bcb91d903abcd88bacd1fdb0336a75cd9fd25", "ja": "ずっと歩いてきた道のりで、約束ですのよ！？\nそれを……裏切ることになりますのよ！？", "zh": "这是我们一路走来的历程，也是约定啊！？\n那样做……就是背叛约定了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1021_p", "source_sha256": "74b6b68fb32a6ea4cc82c9d0c2e12b24a92d96bca7ac7bb47d22c43a181113b4", "ja": "……そう、かもしれません、でも！\nこのままだと千鶴さんが……！", "zh": "……也许，真的是那样，但是！\n要是再这样下去，千鹤你就会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "acb7abfeafce8a2df4128e58df408208cfcab81f280f3eb124cbbac6519e489d", "ja": "イヤです！　もう聞きたくありませんっ。\n……出て行ってくださいまし！", "zh": "不要！我已经不想再听了！\n……请您出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
