{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "f2123a6fe8ac4b280c2dfcb0525c3d929829dd93611f8a16c5647dea59898b1b", "ja": "家のこと、公表したらどうかって……。", "zh": "家里面的事，不如公开出来怎么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1035_chizuruhaha", "source_sha256": "6338f1c6bf15e71ed6f57d9c455472bd04c4c4ee71d933f375f636c5bb9984fb", "ja": "……。あら、そうだったの。", "zh": "……。哎呀，是这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1036_038chz", "source_sha256": "82a3e2a9b0506a906d27845dd41960255c2e06f7f44c9336d0dc792d0d30e53b", "ja": "あの人は、わかってくれてるって……思ってたのに。\n私のこと……。アイドルの、二階堂千鶴のこと。", "zh": "我还以为……那个人是理解我的。\n关于我……关于作为偶像的二阶堂千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "eaa7c8c6f4e6cea976053437ef7fd05eab2d4e49828224e1c7408c94c8c0e8ce", "ja": "あの人と一緒に……なによりも、\n大事にしてきたのに……！", "zh": "明明和那个人一起……把它看得比什么\n都要重要……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1039_chizuruhaha", "source_sha256": "e3bd5fce9e4da50c0f2934dac81847adda64fe38dc3d2d054110f98d94fd24bc", "ja": "大事にされてるじゃない。\nありがたい話よねぇ。", "zh": "这不是挺受重视的嘛。\n真是让人感激呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1040_038chz", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1041_chizuruhaha", "source_sha256": "43d67d34f5a68e38e15e5f3e875567fdbc22d221308866dccbc960b64f8ee654", "ja": "親の贔屓目かもしれないけど、\nアンタも結構有名になってきたみたいだし。", "zh": "也许是父母的偏心眼，\n不过你好像也变得挺有名的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1042_chizuruhaha", "source_sha256": "24e22c63bc49ab07c2c5b6f0ee81c8f29e8c4ba1f1327006a18654411547f516", "ja": "このままもっと有名になってからじゃ、\nもう取り返しがつかなくなるっていうか。", "zh": "要是就这样等变得更出名之后，感觉就再也无法挽回了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1043_chizuruhaha", "source_sha256": "d2055226387c4048f62aab7697283ce5a1ae4c6ae6541f42e852cd686832e653", "ja": "それこそ、大変なことになるんじゃない？\nアンタ自身が誰よりも、今よりもずっと。", "zh": "那样一来，岂不是会变得很不得了？\n你自己会比任何人都……比现在更加……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "fab7a9e4313a786ad52f16338ef4f5173cdf4a1c98887ec17cc8ed0ca2d592b4", "ja": "……！　私を……。", "zh": "……！　要把我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "eb48b788bbe20e64fb8a1b0d62fe04f59c9f59f328e1859a59b0132d0d233b09", "ja": "私を、大事にして……？", "zh": "请珍惜我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1046_null", "source_sha256": "af5c05886be3ebee33c1ffc8b1bdfc9df53da1e70fcc2c44b877b95270d2bc70", "ja": "同じ頃……", "zh": "同一时刻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1047_p", "source_sha256": "4b65ac7d55b56f994356194e5c267ad73baf679fa878a7fe0639459021e8d1a8", "ja": "社長、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "社长，您辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1048_president", "source_sha256": "77139abeaa7e2917aba63544993f839317cbfad246f6400d49bff9386a4b07d6", "ja": "おお、君か。お疲れさま。\n二階堂君は大丈夫かね？", "zh": "哦，是你啊。辛苦了。\n二阶堂没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1049_p", "source_sha256": "ca3c189f69d2195aa3db67e7b3bb7666bfd2d077ca8ed00b82138a89977dac94", "ja": "はい、用意していただいたホテルに送りました。\n……気持ち的には、落ち込んでると思いますが……。", "zh": "是的，我已经把她送到您安排的酒店了。\n……不过从心情上来说，她应该很消沉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1050_president", "source_sha256": "4359f96de853d9d2deb734bdc5db5d789f61adea401cb300ee7decd6c73c228a", "ja": "うん？　どうかしたのかね？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1051_p", "source_sha256": "190a0de78cf2b41fa592c5eb664e44bb16451cf949238f0647ad8cb533febd20", "ja": "あ、いや……。\n実は……千鶴さんと、口論になってしまったんです。", "zh": "啊，不，没什么……\n其实……我和千鹤小姐吵起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1052_president", "source_sha256": "cb9978c76370e838e51ab5f86d6fb89042cc187d5eb6ea6a9059f25e5af3b467", "ja": "口論？", "zh": "争论？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1053_p", "source_sha256": "eaf270ac2003d94dfae10f9c1743a61d6a4c6fd431ec0ad7acd94b8c5a9818c1", "ja": "はい……。本当のことが明るみになってしまう前に、\nその……。", "zh": "是的……在真相曝光之前，\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1054_p", "source_sha256": "f0393acadb5d75cf2e6529292fb1c9ba165dcb2dc2a45c5994dfd4c6949c1ee6", "ja": "ご実家のことを公表してはどうかと\n提案したんですが……。", "zh": "我提议，不如公开您老家的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1055_president", "source_sha256": "e7a23430d3a953177ac715a56b7272a03b65a9e96fad7272481da5b48a6d235f", "ja": "ほほう。\nそれで、彼女はなんだって？", "zh": "哦？那她说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1056_p", "source_sha256": "5021454109603ad48e34ae215984faefb29cc5cb8e55d172a9cce7bb7982d77e", "ja": "そんなことをしたら、自分が自分でなくなってしまう。\nみんなを裏切ることになる、と……。", "zh": "要是做了那种事，我就不再是我自己了。\n也会变成背叛大家……她是这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1057_president", "source_sha256": "66e8ed00b395cf7c5f198d0dae10f66153ee110ba4ac308dd98618007c9dc686", "ja": "ふむ……なるほど。", "zh": "嗯……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1058_p", "source_sha256": "bfd644f46540b335e97dcffd30af31d03d6036bc306ae809caba0c58a8e6835b", "ja": "最初は、千鶴さんのためにも、\n絶対にそうした方がいいと思っていたはずなのに……。", "zh": "一开始，我明明觉得这样做对千鶴来说也是绝对正确的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1059_p", "source_sha256": "babb71ba6252e68aaa191233da5570426d4b56d0d7dba3e8e788ee8781f34bf6", "ja": "話しているうちに、何故か\n自信がなくなってきてしまって……。", "zh": "聊着聊着，不知为何就开始没了自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1060_president", "source_sha256": "f2bf7f22940a63eed9d16c5f2fcaedd3896b4384f60ae632bc9c0ae622284c02", "ja": "それはそうだろう。", "zh": "那当然了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1061_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1062_president", "source_sha256": "d911cc246992902f67a87f872012cfa702a7894ef9f69339a5bc263c80ab18a8", "ja": "アイドルの輝きとは、紛れもない真実の魂の輝きで\nなくては、誰にも響くことはない。", "zh": "偶像的光辉，必须是毫无疑问的真实灵魂所散发的光辉，  \n否则就无法打动任何人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1063_p", "source_sha256": "ade311a97fc2806f1986ff6612bda4e7eff977dfc503dc769ade51e96c0536af", "ja": "そ、それなら……。", "zh": "那、那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1064_president", "source_sha256": "56340a2342b9f55003d0dd9f57d201950cacf155c5f4f25946f7cf9edd884879", "ja": "だからこそ。\n嘘を真に変えるのが、アイドルの本質ではないのかね？", "zh": "正因如此。\n将谎言化为真实，不正是偶像的本质吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1066_president", "source_sha256": "76b5af0d282cb54f78a8145293b88af61515e83412a22db82622d111bac34c0c", "ja": "もちろん、そこには責任が伴う。覚悟が伴う。\nだが、そこから逃げては得られない輝きがある。", "zh": "当然，这也伴随着责任，伴随着觉悟。\n然而，唯有不从中逃避，才能获得那份光芒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1067_president", "source_sha256": "7ba99d4e78e2db039f96aa4abb7eca58a5f599ad558e2188c6d1525aa78dff42", "ja": "二階堂君は覚悟と引き換えに\n何を追い求めているのか……。", "zh": "二阶堂同学以觉悟为代价，究竟在追求什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1068_president", "source_sha256": "e2c873d31ac97dc046d8e5b147f8957f70a88090a6eb3ee382d90d2cdda6deab", "ja": "君が今日までともに歩んできた、\n彼女の真の輝きとは、どんな在り様なのか……。", "zh": "你与她携手一路走到了今天，\n而她那真正的光芒，究竟会是怎样的姿态……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1069_president", "source_sha256": "346c223d11faed1e0fb5c108da40398abb5cdbf54d5909bdf7ebea14d1646a33", "ja": "君は、よく知っているだろう？", "zh": "你很清楚的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1070_p", "source_sha256": "b863ada456302c1abeec4ae349194296f026e4c43611bdb77a83afcc58e23ef9", "ja": "……そうでした。はい、よく知っています。\nずっと前から……。", "zh": "……确实如此。是的，我很清楚。\n从很久以前开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1071_p", "source_sha256": "7a1954d6756d72488efe0f78c664298df89a81dc611313175a5e8e1cf530ff01", "ja": "彼女と出会った時から、誰よりも！", "zh": "从与她相遇的那一刻起，比任何人都更了解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1072_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1073_038chz", "source_sha256": "c777abca9f8425ac5d471799fa9aafc476266c34c39441a3811915cc87c300f8", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nあの……。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1074_p", "source_sha256": "a81a80c4f4d567326130044248e63b416b41bd844610902c45c2b8b200c1990b", "ja": "千鶴さん、おはようございます。\n出る前に、少しいいですか？", "zh": "千鹤小姐，早上好。\n出发前，可以占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1075_038chz", "source_sha256": "2162afb138bbf4983ca023867137a60f2ac5e96a3e064114d25f56107eca0fa5", "ja": "あ……ええ、もちろんですわ。\nわたくしも、少しお話ししておきたくて。", "zh": "啊……嗯，当然可以。\n我也正好有些话想和您谈谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_144_1076_p", "source_sha256": "d3228a77bc6168678491645d7e5012b3ea0daab8fa96adcbc2153411db139dc5", "ja": "その……、この間はすみませんでした。\n千鶴さんに、あんな提案をしてしまって……。", "zh": "那个……之前的事，真的很抱歉。\n居然向千鹤小姐提出了那样的建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
